sequenceDiagram
    participant App
    participant DB as Business DB + Outbox
    participant Relay
    participant Broker
    participant Consumer
    participant Idem as processed_effects
    participant External as Side-Effect System
    participant Replay

    App->>DB: Commit business transaction + outbox row
    Relay->>Broker: Publish event
    Broker->>Consumer: Deliver event
    Consumer->>Idem: Insert/check effectId
    Idem-->>Consumer: IN_PROGRESS or COMMITTED
    Consumer->>External: Execute side effect
    External-->>Consumer: Success/Failure
    Consumer->>Idem: Mark COMMITTED/FAILED
    Consumer->>Replay: Write Decision Replay Card
